  "details": "Hi there!\n\nI would like to request additional RPCs for the SyncVideo components.\n\n- Delete(X) in order to delete a single item from the playlist. At the moment there is only a clear RPC that deletes the entire playlist\n- OthersBuffered support on Player, so the host is for example able to desync the video for everyone else on purpose. since everyone is synced within the host, there should be a way to substract the latency from the sync time, so it gets more in sync at all (something like the video starts ~300ms later on the host side / sooner on non master side)\n- Option to prevent the playlist from repeating itself after its finished",
